    "created_at": "2022-10-05T14:45:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-05T14:45:24Z",
    "body": "> It seems this is only meant to impact CORS, but wouldn't some of these client hints be added to navigations and such? Some of these headers are added quite late in the game too (e.g., `Cookie` and `Authorization`) and I'm not sure how that would work given the envisioned setup.\r\n\r\nAh, does this require integration in the HTTP spec as well?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
