    "created_at": "2022-10-07T09:56:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-07T09:56:04Z",
    "body": "> Ah, does this require integration in the HTTP spec as well?\r\n\r\nNo, Fetch defines most of the networking architecture of a browser, including navigations (\"`navigate`\") and \"`no-cors`\" requests.",
